 "entities": {},
 "insight": [
  "The value of Luxembourg's imports from EU27 countries increased from 12.76 billion euros in 2005 to 21.72 billion euros in 2025.",
  "This represents a rise of 70.3% over the period.",
  "The largest year-on-year increase for imports from EU27 countries was between 2021 and 2022, rising from 19.65 billion euros to 23.31 billion euros.",
  "In contrast, imports from non-EU27 countries decreased from 5.40 billion euros in 2005 to 3.37 billion euros in 2025, a decline of 37.5%.",
  "These values are nominal and not adjusted for price changes, which may affect comparisons over time."
 ],
